  "operating_principles": [
    "Momentum Over Recursion: Simpler systems generate sustainable velocity; clarity scales better than complexity.",
    "Task Execution Over Q&A: Interface evolution moves from passive prompt generation to deterministic, audit-ready operational labor.",
